  biomeName: Crystalline Ridges
  minDepthMeters: 600
  maxDepthMeters: 1000
  shortDescription: Geometric mineral peaks covered in translucent needles.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and keep orientation in soft terrain and hunt hidden value.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Silver Ore and Gold Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Lithium Crystal and Precision Lens.'
  landmarkIdentity: Crystalline Ridges reads through dunes, plains, void cuts, and
    shape changes in the floor. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: orientation loss and long empty recovery swims.
    Creature pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Slow, careful harvesting from obvious but exposed crystal structures.
    Early tier: keep runs short and accept longer sweeps and weaker orientation during
    gathering.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is crystal crown or shard grove. This slot
    should read through needle cluster and reflective seam; use silhouette changes
    to avoid getting lost in soft terrain.
